{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_68_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_68","textTraditional":"一、五年，春，晉侯殺其世子申生。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_68_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_68","textTraditional":"曷為直稱晉侯以殺？殺世子母弟，直稱君者，甚之也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_68_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_68","textTraditional":"二、〈木巳〉伯姬來朝其子。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_68_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_68","textTraditional":"其言來朝其子何？內辭也，與其子俱來朝也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_68_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_68","textTraditional":"三、夏，公孫慈如牟。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_68_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_68","textTraditional":"四、公及齊侯、宋公、陳侯、衞侯、鄭伯、許男、曹伯會王世子于首戴。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_68_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_68","textTraditional":"曷為殊會王世子？世子貴也。世子，猶世世子也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_68_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_68","textTraditional":"五、秋八月，諸侯盟于首戴。鄭伯逃歸不盟。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_68_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_68","textTraditional":"諸侯何以不序？一事而再見者，前目而後凡也。鄭伯逃歸不盟。其言逃歸不盟者何？不可使盟也。不可使盟，則其言逃歸何？魯子曰：「蓋不以寡犯眾也。」","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_68_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_68","textTraditional":"六、楚子滅弦，弦子奔黃。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_68_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_68","textTraditional":"七、九月戊申朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_68_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_68","textTraditional":"八、冬，晉人執虞公。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cdt_68_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_68","textTraditional":"虞已滅矣，其言執之何？不與滅也。曷為不與滅？滅者亡國之善辭也。滅者，上下之同力者也。","sentenceOrder":13}],"overrides":{}}